"name": "PROG Holdings, Inc.",
"description": "PROG Holdings, Inc. engages in the provision of lease-purchase solutions. It offers retail sale and lease ownership of furniture, home appliances, consumer electronics, and accessories through its franchised stores and e-commerce platform. It operates through the following segments: Progressive Leasing and Four. The Progressive Leasing segment offers lease-to-own ownership of durable goods. The Four segment includes provision of credit backgrounds with Buy Now, Pay Later plans. The company was founded in 1955 and is headquartered in Draper, UT.",
